    // render makes React detach and re-attach the ref on each commit,
    // re-invoking the user's ref callback on every render. In React 19, when
    // that callback schedules an update (e.g. Slate/Plate editor refs), every
    // re-attachment nests another update and React eventually throws
    // "Maximum update depth exceeded".
